{
    "title": "Smart Brain: Mind-Blowing Game",
    "description": "Play insanely fun brain games & brain puzzles that'll force your mind to think outside the box. Smart Brain games consist of 250+ levels of brain teasers, tricky puzzles, and emoji quizzes to test your IQ.\r\n\r\nSmart Brain is the ultimate brain game for all puzzle fans. For some puzzles, you\u2019ll utilize your logical mind while others will test IQ; for some, you\u2019ll need observation skills while for others, a knack for trivia games; for some you\u2019ll tap your creative thinking while for others simple common sense. And all these fun and unique brain games come with fantastic visuals and interactive gameplay giving you a good casual gaming experience. And this epic experience is what makes Smart Brain a top-rated game for brain.\r\n\r\nSmart Brain \u2014 Addictive Mind Games For All Ages.\r\n- Hundreds of tricky puzzles, brain games, brain teasers to solve.\r\n- The entertaining brain puzzles for your pastime.\r\n- Challenge and test your friends and family\u2019s intelligence with brain games\r\n- Unlock exciting new game modes.\r\n- An ideal free casual game.\r\n- Out of the box game answers for puzzles and quizzes.\r\n- Unique and quirky levels that you\u2019ll find nowhere else.\r\n- Work your creative problem solving and pump those logical muscles.\r\n- Boost lateral thinking and challenge your IQ.\r\n- Questions that make you focus on minute details, enhance observation.\r\n- Problems that blow your mind with out-of-the-box solutions.\r\n- Challenging enough to make grown-ups think.\r\n- Fun enough to make everyone laugh.\r\n- Stimulate your brain for a healthy mind.\r\n\r\nHoly cow \u2014 this sounds exactly like the brain game you were looking for!\r\n\r\nWho is this brain game for?\r\nIf you like logical games, riddles, math games, jigsaw puzzle games, word search games, quiz games, and trivia games then Smart Brain game is just for you. Download Now for FREE.\r\nSmart Brain is not your regular easy game \u2014 it's the ultimate brain test.\r\n\r\nYou\u2019ve to break free from normal thinking, come up with something absurdly creative, something that pops your brain out, something that makes your brain sweat, something that makes your neurons wiggle \u2014 you gotta have a smart mind.\r\n\r\nCan you do it? Are you a \u201cSmart Brain\u201d? Yes, you are?!\r\nSo just play the game and prove your intelligence to the world.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 Tricky puzzles\r\n\u2022 Funny game answers.\r\n\u2022 Fun for all ages: Good for family & friends\u2019 gatherings!\r\n\u2022 Download this funny game for free.\r\n\u2022 Great exercise for the brain.\r\n\u2022 Simple and highly addictive gameplay.\r\n\u2022 Play without the internet.\r\n\u2022 Play offline.\r\n\r\nHave fun!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play insanely fun brain games &amp; brain puzzles that&#39;ll force your mind to think outside the box. Smart Brain games consist of 250+ levels of brain teasers, tricky puzzles, and emoji quizzes to test your IQ.<br><br>Smart Brain is the ultimate brain game for all puzzle fans. For some puzzles, you\u2019ll utilize your logical mind while others will test IQ; for some, you\u2019ll need observation skills while for others, a knack for trivia games; for some you\u2019ll tap your creative thinking while for others simple common sense. And all these fun and unique brain games come with fantastic visuals and interactive gameplay giving you a good casual gaming experience. And this epic experience is what makes Smart Brain a top-rated game for brain.<br><br>Smart Brain \u2014 Addictive Mind Games For All Ages.<br>- Hundreds of tricky puzzles, brain games, brain teasers to solve.<br>- The entertaining brain puzzles for your pastime.<br>- Challenge and test your friends and family\u2019s intelligence with brain games<br>- Unlock exciting new game modes.<br>- An ideal free casual game.<br>- Out of the box game answers for puzzles and quizzes.<br>- Unique and quirky levels that you\u2019ll find nowhere else.<br>- Work your creative problem solving and pump those logical muscles.<br>- Boost lateral thinking and challenge your IQ.<br>- Questions that make you focus on minute details, enhance observation.<br>- Problems that blow your mind with out-of-the-box solutions.<br>- Challenging enough to make grown-ups think.<br>- Fun enough to make everyone laugh.<br>- Stimulate your brain for a healthy mind.<br><br>Holy cow \u2014 this sounds exactly like the brain game you were looking for!<br><br>Who is this brain game for?<br>If you like logical games, riddles, math games, jigsaw puzzle games, word search games, quiz games, and trivia games then Smart Brain game is just for you. Download Now for FREE.<br>Smart Brain is not your regular easy game \u2014 it&#39;s the ultimate brain test.<br><br>You\u2019ve to break free from normal thinking, come up with something absurdly creative, something that pops your brain out, something that makes your brain sweat, something that makes your neurons wiggle \u2014 you gotta have a smart mind.<br><br>Can you do it? Are you a \u201cSmart Brain\u201d? Yes, you are?!<br>So just play the game and prove your intelligence to the world.<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 Tricky puzzles<br>\u2022 Funny game answers.<br>\u2022 Fun for all ages: Good for family &amp; friends\u2019 gatherings!<br>\u2022 Download this funny game for free.<br>\u2022 Great exercise for the brain.<br>\u2022 Simple and highly addictive gameplay.<br>\u2022 Play without the internet.<br>\u2022 Play offline.<br><br>Have fun!",
